<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="9e32390a">&lt;p&gt;
    Documentation that is used to show the current and future state inventory of organizational roles, their
    descriptions and level of accountability. It can be used to understand what the current state consists of, as well as
    what is required to meet future state needs.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="56c96b6e"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="1aa1bc88"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="d2da80a0"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="e7c1729">&lt;p&gt;
    To provide a clear definition and understanding of the roles and responsibilities within an organization.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="impactOfNotHaving" nodeId="c1b6d868"></attribute>
<attribute name="reasonsForNotNeeding" nodeId="50f46679"></attribute>
<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="e4537c3d"></attribute>
<attribute name="representationOptions" nodeId="88459097">&lt;p&gt;
    For a baseline understanding or to outline the roles and responsibilities a spreadsheet format may be used that
    includes role name, description and key responsibilities. To provide additional detail and design the future state role
    profile, the Role Profile template may be used.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    A RACI may be completed to further detail out the responsibilities which can assist in creating role profiles.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="representation" nodeId="b9e29635"></attribute>
<attribute name="notation" nodeId="f7202f6c"></attribute>
